{"id":"c03","stage":0,"title":"这是我的书","scene":"在教室里辨认物品。","roles":["敏智","你"],"lines":[{"id":"c03-1","ko":"이게 뭐예요?","zh":"这是什么？","note":"이게 是 이것이 的口语缩略形式。","words":[{"term":"이것","zh":"这个","id":"e414d84c28c86213","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/07bbf423148c7b229940.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"이게","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이것（这个）+ 이（主格助词）→ 이것이，口语缩略为이게。","readings":[{"term":"이것","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3"}]},{"text":"뭐예요?","meaning":"是什么？","explanation":"뭐（什么）+ 예요（是，礼貌体）。","readings":[{"term":"뭐예요","audio":"/audio/4f5cef3090eaab6a16ff.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c03-2","ko":"한국어 책이에요.","zh":"是韩语书。","note":"책 有收音，所以用 이에요。","words":[{"term":"책","zh":"书","id":"ba928dd573a2db9e","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/51347a79bed97955fefd.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"한국어","meaning":"韩语","explanation":"한국어作名词修饰语，说明书的内容。","readings":[{"term":"한국어","audio":"/audio/ea3252281bc3bcec5672.mp3"}]},{"text":"책이에요.","meaning":"是书","explanation":"책（书）+ 이에요（是，用在有收音名词后）。","readings":[{"term":"책","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c03-3","ko":"이 책은 누구 거예요?","zh":"这本书是谁的？","note":"누구 거：谁的东西，口语中常用。","words":[{"term":"누구","zh":"谁","id":"e9e6266b8035d7c4","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"},{"term":"거","zh":"东西（口语）","id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/642ed35bfa8157929d0a.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这","explanation":"이是指示限定词，修饰后面的책。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}]},{"text":"책은","meaning":"这本书","explanation":"책（书）+ 은（有收音后的话题助词）。","readings":[{"term":"책은","audio":"/audio/8966259a81fab6fe0e30.mp3"}]},{"text":"누구","meaning":"谁的","explanation":"누구（谁）；在누구 거中所属助词의被省略。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"},{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}]},{"text":"거예요?","meaning":"东西？","explanation":"거（것“东西”的口语形式）+ 예요（是）；누구 거意为“谁的东西”。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"},{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c03-4","ko":"제 책이에요.","zh":"是我的书。","note":"제 是 저의 的缩略形式，表示“我的”。","words":[{"term":"제","zh":"我的（谦称）","id":"b94e182b9a95d9dc","audio":"/audio/b94e182b9a95d9dc2329.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/a7c69e0821a10dbf4334.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"제","meaning":"我的","explanation":"저의（我的，谦称）缩略为제。","readings":[{"term":"제","audio":"/audio/b94e182b9a95d9dc2329.mp3"}]},{"text":"책이에요.","meaning":"是书","explanation":"책（书）+ 이에요（是）；整句意为“是我的书”。","readings":[{"term":"책이에요","audio":"/audio/198a3dc373dbc20a6b05.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c03-5","ko":"펜도 있어요?","zh":"你也有笔吗？","note":"있어요 表示“有”或“在”。","words":[{"term":"펜","zh":"笔","id":"e414ad855b8d4825","audio":"/audio/e414ad855b8d4825e031.mp3"},{"term":"있다","zh":"有；在","id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/fac466d26b25f4e2ce13.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"펜도","meaning":"笔也","explanation":"펜（笔）+ 도（也）。","readings":[{"term":"펜","audio":"/audio/e414ad855b8d4825e031.mp3"}]},{"text":"있어요?","meaning":"有吗？","explanation":"있다（有、在）的礼貌形式；这里问是否拥有。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c03-6","ko":"네, 가방 안에 있어요.","zh":"有，在包里。","note":"안에 表示“在里面”。","words":[{"term":"가방","zh":"包","id":"6852b2954fc85566","audio":"/audio/6852b2954fc8556674f1.mp3"},{"term":"안","zh":"里面","id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/478ee47f883ee30be5bf.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"有","explanation":"네肯定回答上文的“有笔吗”。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}]},{"text":"가방","meaning":"包","explanation":"가방是名词，和后面的안组成“包里面”。","readings":[{"term":"가방","audio":"/audio/6852b2954fc8556674f1.mp3"},{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}]},{"text":"안에","meaning":"在里面","explanation":"안（里面）+ 에（存在的位置）。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}]},{"text":"있어요.","meaning":"有／在","explanation":"있다的礼貌形式；这里说明笔的位置。","readings":[{"term":"있어요","audio":"/audio/499f8423f214354759ff.mp3"}]}]}],"day":11,"sequenceScore":0.8934,"questions":[{"lineIndex":2,"options":["这本书多少钱？","这本书是谁的？","你要哪一本书？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":4,"options":["你也有书吗？","你需要买笔吗？","你也有笔吗？"],"answer":2}]}
